subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Show monthly spending timeline with bar chart

USAGE:
  subtrack timeline <OPTIONS>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                 Display this help message
  -v, --version              Display this version
  --months <months>          Number of months (default: 12)
  -c, --categories           Show breakdown by category (first tag)
  -j, --json                 Output as JSON

